{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","bright":1,"img":"chara004_1","x":450,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"y":-204,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","bright":1,"img":"chara004_1","x":450,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"transTime":300,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"y":-204,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]是给梅莉莉的委托品吗？这些是……唉？那些守军的牢骚让她听见了？[r]噗。这孩子真是嘴上一套心里一套。那些卫兵也没有恶意，她是懂的。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾尔莎"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]溢水商路的驻防是相当艰苦的工作。那边的危险，在这旅店的你我可能都想象不到。[r]梅莉莉是担心他们的身体，为了最大化营养，才牺牲了料理的口感。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾尔莎"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]既然她想为了他们做出更可口的饭菜，就尊重她的意愿吧。[r]这是说好的酬劳，多谢你，契约者。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾尔莎"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"wt_yz_05_1_y","des":"为商路守军提供活血草"}